{"reviewId": "35067809_86NjaZj1S", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "虽然纸币在贬值，但作者认为康波的规律没变。只要我们换一把尺子——用黄金来衡量价格。\n\n黄金原油价格比率（Gold/Oil Ratio）： 这是一个非常经典的指标。\n\n“黄金原油价格比率一直围绕着中枢波动。”\n\n这意味着，如果你用美元看石油，石油价格可能翻了10倍；但如果你用黄金看石油，你会发现一盎司黄金能买到的石油桶数，在几十年里其实是相对稳定的。\n\n结论： 尽管纸币洪水滔天，改变了价格的绝对值（让它看起来更高），但没有改变价格波动的形式和周期。黄金，依然是康波周期中最诚实的锚。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "在第四次康波之后，世界货币本位制彻底与黄金脱钩，初级产品价格水平呈现一个中枢不断上移的态势，货币本位制的变化的确改变了价格波动的中枢，", "range": "8550-8617", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "35067809_86NjaZj1S", "userVid": 35067809, "topics": [], "createTime": 1770651313, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 35067809, "name": "D", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/SgKic6weIhq6zQwaVOXHrj27y3w0PE4XK3bv187iaRhAUMWBl4rzF0YKoSY9W7GYHoWhDcKJHffF0JCP4FZmD3sCo58rxZdRsrGveXjC0XBHY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 65, "likes": [{"userVid": 346081632, "name": "北海", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/bMMZRFtrhzv62eMrQtSwGdcPpWMgicEiawaEt1icxzVxUsicMHyNv8pqZUmzzgV4kAKM1I8vMwmIH3oMU8jPcv8LIKSiauWYZOrhVexV6jNJtEIU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-500", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞",